WEBVTT

00:01.876 --> 00:05.422
I'm watching you from over here!
You better not stop!

00:05.505 --> 00:07.424
Rocket Engine Valve.

00:09.050 --> 00:09.968
Hello.

00:10.051 --> 00:11.636
I am Rocket Engine Valve.

00:14.639 --> 00:16.099
Huh? Momo?

00:17.350 --> 00:18.601
Jiji?

00:25.191 --> 00:28.653
Yo. You're finally here.
I heard all about it from your mom.

00:28.737 --> 00:30.905
Huh? What? Why is he here?

00:30.989 --> 00:32.365
Who is that?

00:32.449 --> 00:35.994
That guy is Momo's childhood friend...

00:37.412 --> 00:39.039
and her first love.

00:46.254 --> 00:49.674
Miss Ayase's first love?

00:50.258 --> 00:51.551
He looks so cool.

00:52.135 --> 00:55.138
From how he's dressed,
he's definitely an athlete.

00:55.221 --> 00:57.557
He looks really sincere, too.

00:57.640 --> 01:01.811
Miss Ayase falling for him
must mean that he's a proper guy.

01:04.105 --> 01:07.942
Momo, you're such a cutie!

01:10.403 --> 01:13.323
And your terrible impression...

01:13.406 --> 01:14.574
So priceless!

01:16.993 --> 01:18.995
It's been a while, Momo.

01:19.079 --> 01:20.580
Wanna hug for starters?

01:20.663 --> 01:22.832
So annoying. What's with you?

01:22.916 --> 01:25.335
I got me an "annoying"!

01:26.503 --> 01:28.546
Gimme more!

01:28.630 --> 01:30.799
Okarun, help me kill this guy.

01:30.882 --> 01:33.051
Long time no see, Jiji.

01:33.134 --> 01:35.053
Oh, good evening!

01:35.637 --> 01:37.055
It's been a while!

01:37.138 --> 01:39.516
You're still as beautiful as ever, Auntie!

01:39.599 --> 01:43.520
You've grown up into quite the genius.
Well, come on in.

01:43.603 --> 01:46.231
Huh? Wait a sec, what's going on here?

01:48.191 --> 01:50.110
What? Isn't it obvious?

01:50.193 --> 01:52.529
He's gonna live with us starting today.

01:55.031 --> 01:57.659
Huh? What for?

01:57.742 --> 01:59.661
Absolutely not!

01:59.744 --> 02:03.706
"Absolutely!" and "Not!"
still means you like it!

02:05.500 --> 02:06.918
Are you a genius?

02:07.001 --> 02:09.170
Thanks for having me, fam!

02:09.254 --> 02:11.881
Whoa! What about my permission?!

02:11.965 --> 02:14.050
L-Live together?

02:14.592 --> 02:16.261
It's too unnatural.

02:16.845 --> 02:19.514
Is she getting another new demon?

02:21.182 --> 02:23.935
Can it be that she's diligently
gathering allies

02:24.018 --> 02:27.522
to prepare for the coming of Ragnarok,
the final war?

02:27.605 --> 02:29.023
I don't think that's it.

02:29.107 --> 02:31.651
I won't allow it, Momo Ayase!

02:32.152 --> 02:33.319
What's up with you?

02:33.403 --> 02:35.947
I can totally see through your schemes!

02:36.030 --> 02:39.325
We're temporary allies
against the alien threat,

02:39.409 --> 02:41.953
but once that's over, you're next!

02:42.036 --> 02:44.622
Huh? Is she still hooked on that idea?

02:44.706 --> 02:45.790
Seems so.

02:45.874 --> 02:49.544
I will gather forces as well
to challenge your Ragnarok!

02:49.627 --> 02:50.378
See you!

02:52.672 --> 02:53.840
Thanks for your effort.

02:53.923 --> 02:57.010
All these troublesome things
came rushing over at once!

02:58.469 --> 03:01.347
Well, I'll head home now, too.

03:01.431 --> 03:03.057
Oh. Okay.

03:05.560 --> 03:06.728
Take care.

03:07.312 --> 03:08.313
Okay.

03:27.498 --> 03:29.042
Hey, Okarun.

03:37.091 --> 03:37.967
Huh?

03:41.971 --> 03:43.264
What is it?

03:45.808 --> 03:49.479
"See you tomorrow!"
It's your turn to say it, Okarun!

03:50.146 --> 03:51.022
Huh?

03:51.606 --> 03:53.691
We're taking turns?

03:53.775 --> 03:55.568
We are! So just say it!

03:55.652 --> 03:57.153
Oh, er...

03:58.529 --> 03:59.739
Um...

04:00.448 --> 04:01.783
See you...

04:01.866 --> 04:02.992
tomorrow.

04:05.453 --> 04:06.496
Good.

04:07.997 --> 04:09.040
Okay.

04:33.523 --> 04:35.358
I'm not convinced.

04:35.858 --> 04:36.818
KEEP OUT / JIJI'S ROOM

04:36.901 --> 04:40.488
Why is Jiji living at our place?
Give me a proper explanation.

04:40.571 --> 04:43.157
Auntie's cooking is too good!

04:44.450 --> 04:46.160
Are you a genius?

04:46.244 --> 04:47.537
Are you listening?

04:47.620 --> 04:49.747
I told you already.

04:49.831 --> 04:53.209
Both of Jiji's parents
have been hospitalized.

04:53.293 --> 04:54.877
But why our place?

04:54.961 --> 04:57.338
You usually go to a relative's house
in times like this.

04:57.422 --> 04:59.716
You're so cold-hearted.

04:59.799 --> 05:02.552
Society is about helping each other out.

05:02.635 --> 05:04.804
Auntie, you're so cool.

05:04.887 --> 05:08.725
Come on now, Jiji.
You really are a genius.

05:08.808 --> 05:10.101
Make sure to eat up!

05:10.184 --> 05:11.769
Tank you!

05:11.853 --> 05:14.105
He just got you by the heartstrings!

05:14.188 --> 05:18.067
Don't be dumb. Nobody's ever
gotten me by my heartstrings.

05:18.151 --> 05:21.404
Auntie, you're a serious cutie!

05:21.487 --> 05:24.115
Jiji, just how much of a genius are you?

05:24.198 --> 05:25.616
Make sure to eat up, okay?

05:25.700 --> 05:27.702
Tank you!

05:29.037 --> 05:30.830
There's definitely
something funny going on.

05:30.913 --> 05:32.540
Tank you!

05:32.623 --> 05:34.334
I meant something is weird!

05:35.335 --> 05:38.671
Did we get along that well to begin with?

05:38.755 --> 05:43.092
Back in grade school,
I made fun of you, Momo.

05:43.176 --> 05:45.762
Looking back now, I seriously regret it.

05:46.387 --> 05:47.972
Thing is...

05:48.931 --> 05:51.100
I can see ghosts now.

05:51.893 --> 05:54.771
Wait, did you pick up
a golden ball by any chance?

05:54.854 --> 05:56.064
Golden ball?

05:56.564 --> 05:58.483
Did I make a dirty joke at some point?

05:58.566 --> 06:01.319
Oh, no. Forget I said that.

06:01.944 --> 06:05.615
I moved away, so we went
to different middle schools, right?

06:05.698 --> 06:08.201
We moved way out into the mountains.

06:08.284 --> 06:10.912
I've always liked places
with lots of nature.

06:11.412 --> 06:16.417
And the new house was big and clean,
so I was all hyped up in the beginning.

06:17.126 --> 06:22.340
But gradually, I started feeling
like something was off.

06:23.466 --> 06:30.473
It's hard to explain, but the things
lying around, the toilet, the bathroom...

06:31.224 --> 06:33.935
They were somehow different than usual.

06:34.519 --> 06:36.896
I told my parents,
but they wouldn't listen.

06:36.979 --> 06:41.359
I had to convince myself
that I was imagining things.

06:41.442 --> 06:44.612
I lived each day pretending
I didn't notice anything.

06:45.905 --> 06:49.367
But it became so clear
and was telling me to look at it.

06:50.993 --> 06:53.621
It went out of its way
to show itself before me.

06:56.874 --> 07:00.670
And ever since, I see it all the time.

07:02.338 --> 07:05.967
My parents' health started
going downhill from there.

07:06.759 --> 07:12.140
That's why I asked famous
spirit mediums for an exorcism.

07:13.641 --> 07:17.103
And when I did,
three of the five committed suicide.

07:19.772 --> 07:22.358
Veteran spirit mediums
couldn't exorcise it.

07:22.442 --> 07:26.487
And the person they recommended
to me as my last hope...

07:26.571 --> 07:28.281
was Momo's Auntie.

07:31.325 --> 07:33.244
So that's what's going on.

07:33.327 --> 07:35.496
You should've just told me sooner!

07:35.580 --> 07:39.208
That old hag didn't even mention
you were coming.

07:40.042 --> 07:43.254
But it was probably the right thing
to do to come to us.

07:43.337 --> 07:44.380
Momo.

07:44.464 --> 07:45.715
I'm sorry.

07:45.798 --> 07:47.633
Wait, can you stop that?

07:47.717 --> 07:49.135
Sorry for what?

07:49.927 --> 07:53.097
All sorts of stuff.
Like how I made fun of you in the past.

07:53.181 --> 07:55.808
How I'm roping you
into something this dangerous.

07:56.392 --> 07:59.103
If you're gonna apologize,
don't come asking for help.

08:00.188 --> 08:03.107
It's fine. My grandma's really tough.

08:03.649 --> 08:06.736
I'm sure she'll beat
that evil spirit with one blow.

08:07.987 --> 08:09.697
I ain't gonna do nothing.

08:09.780 --> 08:10.615
Huh?

08:10.698 --> 08:15.369
Like I said, I can only use my powers
within Kamigoe City.

08:15.453 --> 08:17.872
Momo will take on this request.

08:17.955 --> 08:19.874
Say what? You didn't tell me this!

08:19.957 --> 08:23.669
Hold up!
Did you just call Auntie "Grandma"?

08:23.753 --> 08:27.632
Someone who couldn't see ghosts
can see them now.

08:28.257 --> 08:31.761
Maybe that golden ball
has something to do with it.

08:32.428 --> 08:36.432
If you take this request, I'll buy you
as many uniforms as you want.

08:37.225 --> 08:40.186
So go blow down that cursed house.

10:11.485 --> 10:15.364
Hey there! I transferred schools!

10:15.448 --> 10:17.950
Bo-Bo-Bo-Boom!

10:19.952 --> 10:21.662
I'm Jin Enjoji.

10:22.288 --> 10:23.873
Please call me Jiji!

10:23.956 --> 10:25.625
Whoa, he's cool!

10:25.708 --> 10:27.251
He's a hottie!

10:29.170 --> 10:30.796
Enjoji's parents...

10:30.880 --> 10:33.424
You're such a cutie!

10:34.133 --> 10:36.969
...uh, are both in the hospital now.

10:37.053 --> 10:40.931
Oh, this is terrible. If I don't get
your contact info, it'll kill me!

10:41.015 --> 10:46.145
I'm sure he's having a hard time,
so everyone, please help him out.

10:46.228 --> 10:50.024
He'll be sitting next to Ayase.
You guys are relatives, right?

10:50.107 --> 10:51.942
Nope! We're family!

10:52.026 --> 10:53.736
We're neither of those.

10:53.819 --> 10:55.613
Flashy guys are annoying.

10:55.696 --> 11:00.034
Stabbed! Thank you for that
tasty roast from a beauty!

11:00.117 --> 11:01.077
Beauty?

11:01.160 --> 11:03.412
Momo, this guy's all good.

11:06.666 --> 11:08.292
He's a hottie.

11:08.376 --> 11:11.962
Hey! I'm a super hottie! Pout, pout!

11:12.046 --> 11:14.215
Wait, I'm being drawn ever closer.

11:14.298 --> 11:16.759
It's because you're too cute.

11:16.842 --> 11:19.261
What's with him? He's hilarious!

11:19.345 --> 11:20.304
Oui!

11:20.388 --> 11:21.764
Yeah, so who is he?

11:21.847 --> 11:24.392
How to put it...

11:24.475 --> 11:27.937
A childhood friend-type from grade school.

11:28.854 --> 11:30.398
We're living together!

11:31.440 --> 11:32.566
What? For real?

11:32.650 --> 11:35.528
Hey, stop that!
You'll start strange rumors!

11:35.611 --> 11:37.279
Let me explain everything
properly in order.

11:37.363 --> 11:38.906
- Wait, Momo...
- No, it's not...

11:38.989 --> 11:40.825
Lovey...

11:40.908 --> 11:42.034
dovey!

11:42.868 --> 11:45.871
Momo and I are in
a parentally approved relationship!

11:46.914 --> 11:47.790
Living together?

11:47.873 --> 11:48.749
Seriously?

11:48.833 --> 11:50.376
You can't do that!

11:50.459 --> 11:54.255
Momo already has Okarun!

11:55.089 --> 11:58.801
"Jealous" is an "adjective"
which describes nouns.

11:58.884 --> 12:00.761
You can be jealous of another's happ--

12:00.845 --> 12:02.430
It's bugging me.

12:03.013 --> 12:04.932
Miss Ayase's first love...

12:05.516 --> 12:07.852
Does she still like him?

12:08.561 --> 12:15.192
He called Miss Ayase "Momo,"
and said she was cute.

12:15.943 --> 12:18.446
Could their feelings be mutual?

12:20.239 --> 12:23.492
So "beautiful" and "cool"
are adjectives as well.

12:23.576 --> 12:26.454
If Miss Ayase were to start dating him...

12:28.497 --> 12:31.792
will she stop being so kind to me?

12:32.418 --> 12:37.381
I'm sure she'll be interested in his
hobbies and lose interest in the occult.

12:37.465 --> 12:40.801
I won't be able to talk about
the occult during recess anymore.

12:40.885 --> 12:43.929
Maybe I won't be able to hang out
with Miss Ayase anymore.

13:03.032 --> 13:05.826
I'm no good.

13:09.788 --> 13:13.542
Stop distracting yourself, Ken!

13:13.626 --> 13:20.591
Physical training is more important
right now than such thoughts!

13:24.762 --> 13:26.263
Oh, there you are.

13:28.182 --> 13:31.685
What're you doing?
Practicing a new ultimate move?

13:35.189 --> 13:38.651
Miss Ayase, you already ate lunch?

13:38.734 --> 13:40.069
I'm gonna eat here.

13:40.152 --> 13:41.195
Huh?

13:41.278 --> 13:44.865
I'm watching over you
so you don't do anything funny again.

13:44.949 --> 13:46.242
Watching over me?

13:46.909 --> 13:50.204
That incident with Miss Shiratori
wasn't my fault.

13:51.205 --> 13:53.457
Okarun, did you eat lunch?

13:53.541 --> 13:55.167
Not yet.

13:55.251 --> 13:57.336
If both your hands are tied up...

13:57.419 --> 13:59.380
I'll feed you.

13:59.463 --> 14:00.089
Huh?

14:01.799 --> 14:04.885
I-Is that all right?

14:05.844 --> 14:06.804
Momo!

14:08.013 --> 14:10.641
Oh? You're the guy
who was at Momo's place yesterday.

14:10.724 --> 14:11.809
You a friend?

14:15.312 --> 14:18.065
What do you want? Weren't you gonna eat
with Miko and the others?

14:18.148 --> 14:22.945
Oh? Is Momo-chan jealous? Such a cutie!

14:23.028 --> 14:24.321
As if.

14:24.405 --> 14:25.447
Check it out!

14:25.531 --> 14:27.408
Yogurt-flavored Pompy!

14:29.493 --> 14:31.287
Are you serious?

14:31.370 --> 14:33.789
Present for you, woo!

14:42.631 --> 14:44.091
This is futile.

14:44.633 --> 14:48.387
I can't watch Miss Ayase amicably
talk to that guy any longer.

14:49.096 --> 14:51.098
I'll try not to see her anymore.

14:51.181 --> 14:55.853
That will be the best move for me,
and for Miss Ayase.

14:58.188 --> 15:00.524
I'm not gonna give up!

15:10.618 --> 15:15.581
Miss Ayase!

15:17.082 --> 15:18.500
I'm scared!

15:18.584 --> 15:20.586
Get outta my way!

15:21.211 --> 15:24.048
Nobody can stop me!

15:24.131 --> 15:25.633
Huh? What is it this time?

15:25.716 --> 15:27.927
Whoa, what's that? Seriously wicked!

15:28.010 --> 15:30.054
Stop right there, you half-wit!

15:30.137 --> 15:31.472
Momo, let's run for it!

15:31.555 --> 15:33.682
Don't get in my way!

15:33.766 --> 15:36.644
- Momo!
- Don't say I didn't warn you!

15:46.236 --> 15:47.613
Okarun! His ball...

15:47.696 --> 15:51.283
- It's golden!
- Momo, hide behind me!

15:51.367 --> 15:53.535
- Jiji, calm down!
- Hold it!

15:53.619 --> 15:55.871
You're not getting away!

15:57.915 --> 15:59.875
You've got some nerves!

16:02.127 --> 16:03.253
Okarun!

16:03.337 --> 16:05.005
Miss Ayase!

16:05.089 --> 16:07.925
- Stop this guy!
- Momo! Hang onto me!

16:08.008 --> 16:13.389
Wait, you right there!
Get away from Miss Ayase!

16:27.236 --> 16:29.321
I don't like it.

16:29.405 --> 16:31.865
I want him to get away from her.

17:00.019 --> 17:04.606
Damn you! I know you're trying
to stop me, but I won't stop!

17:04.690 --> 17:06.066
This makes me wilt.

17:06.150 --> 17:08.235
Another monster came out!

17:08.318 --> 17:09.278
Okarun!

17:13.949 --> 17:16.201
- Okarun!
- Momo-chan! The power lines!

17:30.883 --> 17:32.342
Momo-chan! Where is he?

17:33.343 --> 17:34.303
There!

17:35.888 --> 17:38.140
Thanks, Okarun! You're a lifesaver!

17:39.016 --> 17:41.101
A monster captured us!

17:41.185 --> 17:42.352
I'll protect you, Momo!

17:42.436 --> 17:45.814
Stop that! Okarun is on our side!
He was with us earlier!

17:45.898 --> 17:47.399
No way! For real?

17:47.483 --> 17:48.567
Here goes!

17:50.778 --> 17:53.614
All right, Okarun, brace yourself!

17:53.697 --> 17:54.907
Jiji, help us out!

18:07.044 --> 18:10.547
Give up already, you piece of crap!

18:10.631 --> 18:13.550
We'll slowly pull him here!

18:13.634 --> 18:17.888
No way! I'm not gonna give up!
I don't wanna give up!

18:22.101 --> 18:24.436
Ew! Gross!

18:27.856 --> 18:28.857
Merge!

18:43.122 --> 18:44.665
Momo, he's getting away!

18:44.748 --> 18:46.166
Okarun, after him!

18:51.171 --> 18:53.590
No good. We lost sight of him.

18:55.509 --> 18:58.178
S-So amazing. He transformed and stuff.

18:58.679 --> 19:03.058
What should we do? We don't even
know which way he went.

19:07.104 --> 19:07.938
This way!

19:08.021 --> 19:09.398
Huh? What was that?

19:18.782 --> 19:21.702
Miss Ayase, what have you been doing?

19:25.455 --> 19:26.248
KEEP OUT

19:26.331 --> 19:27.291
Here?

19:30.919 --> 19:33.630
Is it all right to barge in
without asking?

19:35.507 --> 19:36.341
Oh.

19:39.970 --> 19:41.054
Goddamn it.

19:41.138 --> 19:43.140
I was so close.

19:43.724 --> 19:47.394
Miss Ayase, how did you know
where he was headed to?

19:48.729 --> 19:50.814
He looks like he's exhausted?

19:51.732 --> 19:56.320
When he split apart to escape,
I managed to grab just his heart.

19:56.403 --> 20:01.491
I punched it on a hunch, and that
was when I heard him screaming in agony.

20:01.575 --> 20:02.576
Freaky!

20:02.659 --> 20:04.411
Woo! Not bad!

20:04.995 --> 20:07.664
I feel a little sorry for him.

20:10.542 --> 20:13.629
It's not like we want to catch
and eat you.

20:13.712 --> 20:17.132
If you'll promise not to run away,
I'll give you your heart back.

20:17.758 --> 20:21.470
So can you show us your golden nuts?

20:21.553 --> 20:23.305
It might be one of my friend's.

20:23.388 --> 20:26.099
Miss Ayase, can you
please say it more delicately?

20:26.183 --> 20:28.101
Are dirty jokes that popular nowadays?

20:31.897 --> 20:34.816
Taro? Is that you, Taro?

20:36.526 --> 20:37.486
Hana!

20:37.569 --> 20:38.570
Where are you, Hana?

20:38.654 --> 20:39.905
Hana!

20:39.988 --> 20:43.533
No! Don't come here! Please go back, Taro!

20:43.617 --> 20:46.245
No way! I will never give up!

20:46.328 --> 20:49.665
I won't give up on you, Hana!

20:51.500 --> 20:53.543
What? What's going on here?

21:00.592 --> 21:01.635
I found you!

21:02.427 --> 21:03.720
I finally found you!

21:03.804 --> 21:05.305
Why did you come here?

21:05.389 --> 21:07.933
Why did you put yourself
through so much danger?

21:08.016 --> 21:10.394
Because I love you!

21:13.105 --> 21:17.067
Everything changed after I met you.

21:18.068 --> 21:21.446
My world used to be grey,
but thanks to you,

21:22.072 --> 21:24.658
it became so colorful!

21:25.575 --> 21:26.493
We can't!

21:26.576 --> 21:30.414
Our manufacturer's dates
are too far apart!

21:30.497 --> 21:32.249
We live in different worlds!

21:32.332 --> 21:35.627
My duties are all over! Please hurry back.

21:35.711 --> 21:38.005
Otherwise you'll turn into
oversized trash, too!

21:38.088 --> 21:39.339
I don't care.

21:39.423 --> 21:43.385
You're the one I fell in love with.
I won't let go of you no matter what!

21:43.468 --> 21:44.803
Let's run away together!

21:44.886 --> 21:48.640
If I don't do anything right here and now,
I'll regret it for the rest of my life!

21:49.224 --> 21:50.684
Taro!

23:28.615 --> 23:30.659
UMAs were all said to be nonsense,

23:30.742 --> 23:32.661
but they are
"Unidentified Mysterious Animals"

23:32.744 --> 23:34.704
so they are simply
"unidentified" biologically!

23:34.788 --> 23:36.665
- What's gotten into you?
- You're so passionate!

23:36.748 --> 23:38.875
Next episode,
"Let's Go to the Cursed House"!

23:38.959 --> 23:42.921
- So, what got into you now?
- In other words, I'll never give up!
